---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n/config'
import TechStack from '../../components/TechStack.astro'
import { defaultLocale } from '../../i18n/config'
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

type Props = { locale?: Locale }
const { locale = defaultLocale } = Astro.props
const title = locale === 'zh-CN' ? '关于' : 'About'
const description = locale === 'zh-CN'
  ? '关于 MongoRolls：前端工程师，关注工程化、开源与个人写作。'
  : 'About MongoRolls, a frontend engineer interested in web tooling, open source, and writing.'
const headings = [
  {
    depth: 2,
    slug: 'about-site',
    text: locale === 'zh-CN' ? '关于本站' : 'About this site',
  },
  {
    depth: 2,
    slug: 'about-me',
    text: locale === 'zh-CN' ? '关于我' : 'About me',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-footprint',
    text: locale === 'zh-CN' ? '足迹' : 'Footprints',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-contact',
    text: locale === 'zh-CN' ? '联系方式' : 'Contact',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-final',
    text: 'final',
  },
]
---

<BaseLayout
  locale={locale}
  title={title}
  headings={headings}
  description={description}
>
    <article data-pagefind-body class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1 class="sr-only" data-pagefind-meta="title">{title}</h1>
    <h2 id="about-site">{locale === 'zh-CN' ? '关于本站' : 'About this site'}</h2>

    {locale === 'zh-CN'
? (
      <>
        <p>经过多个方案比较，最终选择了现在这套技术栈。</p>
        <p>本站基于 <a class="post-link" href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> 构建，并在此基础上持续定制。</p>
        <p>评论区采用 <a class="post-link" href="https://twikoo.js.org/">Twikoo</a>，数据存储于 MongoDB。</p>
        <p>网站部署在 <a class="post-link" href="https://vercel.com/">Vercel</a>。</p>
      </>
    )
: (
      <>
        <p>After comparing several approaches, I settled on the stack that powers this site today.</p>
        <p>The blog is built with <a class="post-link" href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> and continuously customized as the site evolves.</p>
        <p>Comments are powered by <a class="post-link" href="https://twikoo.js.org/">Twikoo</a> with MongoDB storage.</p>
        <p>The site is deployed on <a class="post-link" href="https://vercel.com/">Vercel</a>.</p>
      </>
    )}

    <h2 id="about-me" class="flex items-center align-center"><span class="mr-2 font-bold text-[#425bc5] text-3xl">#</span>{locale === 'zh-CN' ? '关于我' : 'About me'}</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>👋 {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '我是 MongoRolls' : 'I’m MongoRolls'}</li>
      <li>🔭 {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '一名前端开发工程师' : 'A frontend engineer'}</li>
      <li>🌱 {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '目前就职于网易' : 'Currently working at NetEase'}</li>
      <li>✨ {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '希望持续参与并贡献开源' : 'Working toward contributing more to open source'}</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="my-8 sm:my-16">
      <p>{locale === 'zh-CN' ? '技术栈' : 'Tech stack'}</p>
      <TechStack />
    </div>

    <h3 id="about-me-footprint">🗺️ {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '足迹' : 'Footprints'}</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>{locale === 'zh-CN' ? '工作与生活足迹持续更新中。' : 'Notes from work and life are continually being added.'}</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 id="about-me-contact">📫 {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '联系方式' : 'Contact'}</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>github: <a href="https://github.com/MongoRolls">MongoRolls</a></li>
    </ul>


    <h3 id="about-me-final">Final</h3>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style scoped>
    p,h3 {
        white-space: break-spaces;
    }
</style>
